<title>NETHERLANDS: AALBERTS SEES EPS UPTREND CONTINUING IN 97.</title>
<headline>AALBERTS SEES EPS UPTREND CONTINUING IN 97.</headline>
<text>
<p>AMSTERDAM, Aug 13 (Reuter) Industrial holding company Aalberts said on Wednesday it expected full-year earnings per share would develop in line with the trend of previous years.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring exceptional circumstances, management expects that profit per share for full-1997 will continue to develop in line with the growth of previous years,&quot; Aalberts said in a statement.</p>
</text>
